WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:30.810
<v Speaker 1>This is Jonathan Becker reporting from Pro Tour Prague 2006 where a fantastic place here going at the exotic locations of the Pro Tour, we've come to the Czech Republic. Prague is a gorgeous city, a ton of culture, a lot to do and in keeping with that we had the registration dinner at an authentic check brew pub with live music, a band which is surprisingly popular with the players and and a great time was had by all. One of the big topics of conversation there was John Finkel coming back to the game because he's playing this weekend and now a lot of people rooting for him. But we wanted to find out what people thought,</v>

