00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:33.400
<v Speaker 7>All I can really say is sometimes I wake up in the morning. I do one thing, sometimes I wake up in the morning and I wanna do something else. You know, a few months ago I started waking up in the morning and every once in a while it actually wanna play magic. So, you know, a few months ago I realized, hey, you know, I want to go to Prague.</v>

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:47.160
<v Speaker 1>So will John, top 8 Willie day two. Well, he's gonna have a lot of competition here because as you can see, the place is packed. We have 415 competitors, the largest individual pro tour ever. And so it's going to be a great weekend. Keep coming back for coverage. We're going to keep you in the loop.</v>

